1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,720
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 4=

5
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,320
Is your hangover getting any better?

6
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:21,480
Much better.

7
00:00:22,519 --> 00:00:24,359
I'll try to drink less at work dinners.

8
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:25,600
So please won't worry.

9
00:00:26,519 --> 00:00:27,199
It's okay.

10
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:29,839
After all, we're...

11
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:31,239
we're married.

12
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:37,840
Even if it's a contract marriage,

13
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,719
looking after each other

14
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:43,640
is basic respect.

15
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:51,799
I've got things to do at work.

16
00:00:52,679 --> 00:00:53,439
I'd better go.

17
00:00:54,039 --> 00:00:54,560
Okay.

18
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:10,599
Will you be home for dinner?

19
00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:15,040
Yeah.

20
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:25,280
(Jiangcheng University)

21
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:38,879
What do you want?

22
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:42,120
Got Miss Xie backing you? Feeling smug?

23
00:01:43,519 --> 00:01:46,000
Keeping Zheng hooked on you?

24
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:48,040
Playing hard to get again?

25
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:50,159
Li Siyan, watch your mouth.

26
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,280
I...

27
00:01:53,599 --> 00:01:55,640
Get on your knees and apologize
to my sister tonight.

28
00:01:55,799 --> 00:01:57,439
Swear you'll stop chasing Zheng,

29
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,519
and I'll let you off.

30
00:02:05,719 --> 00:02:06,239
First,

31
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,319
Gu Zheng and I are done.

32
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,039
Second,

33
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:10,520
I'm part of the Xie family now.

34
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:13,039
Your family has no right
to tell me what to do.

35
00:02:13,599 --> 00:02:14,199
- Third...
- I...

36
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:19,439
That slap

37
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,919
was for running your mouth.

38
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:22,400
Who's this?

39
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,360
Who let this mutt loose on campus?

40
00:02:27,759 --> 00:02:29,080
She hit me first!

41
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:37,719
Hua.

42
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:39,280
Did you hurt your hand?

43
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,039
I'm fine.

44
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,039
Li Siyan,

45
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:48,199
I'm warning you.

46
00:02:48,599 --> 00:02:50,479
Hua's part of the Xie family now.

47
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:52,400
Disrespect her again,

48
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,000
and you'll answer to me.

49
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,000
I...

50
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:08,719
Hua.

51
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:11,280
Dad's in a bad mood today.

52
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:14,639
He just chewed me out.

53
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:18,120
Sweet-talk him in bed for me?

54
00:03:18,639 --> 00:03:20,039
Didn't you say

55
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:21,800
your dad never loses his cool?

56
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,520
I don't know

57
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,319
what I did to set him off today.

58
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:29,199
Maybe he's

59
00:03:30,039 --> 00:03:30,960
not getting enough?

60
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:33,879
We just

61
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,159
keep things polite.

62
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,280
That's the problem!

63
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:40,560
Hua,

64
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:43,199
how are you two getting along?

65
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:45,719
Pretty well.

66
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,120
He respects my boundaries.

67
00:03:49,759 --> 00:03:50,680
That's just how my dad is.

68
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:52,240
He doesn't let people in.

69
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:53,680
But Hua,

70
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:55,280
let me tell you.

71
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:57,960
My dad's a good man.

72
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:01,960
He's just bad at showing his feelings.

73
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:07,840
Let's get to class.

74
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:10,759
Mr. Xie,

75
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:13,639
revenue through Q3 was
1.28 billion yuan.

76
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,800
That's 78% of our annual target,

77
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:18,040
up 16% year on year.

78
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,360
Next quarter...

79
00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:38,340
♪So many words we once exchanged♪

80
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:42,620
♪How many love stories did we write?♪

81
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,720
(I promised to give her space.)

82
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:49,040
(But whenever I'm around her,)

83
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:50,920
(I lose control so easily.)

84
00:04:52,079 --> 00:04:52,519
Mr. Xie.

85
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,000
That's all for my report.

86
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:55,720
Okay.

87
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:56,879
Get back to work.

88
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:57,639
Yes, Mr. Xie.

89
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:08,560
(First,)

90
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,759
(Gu Zheng and I are done.)

91
00:05:11,399 --> 00:05:11,839
(Second,)

92
00:05:12,519 --> 00:05:13,720
(I'm part of the Xie family now.)

93
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,279
(Your family has no right)

94
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,360
(to tell me what to do.)

95
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:17,600
(Third...)

96
00:05:20,519 --> 00:05:21,000
Zhouhan.

97
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:24,160
Your wife announced she's a Xie

98
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,360
and stood up to Li Siyan.

99
00:05:27,199 --> 00:05:29,319
Looks like my advice worked.

100
00:05:30,279 --> 00:05:32,279
You've won her heart!

101
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,560
♪I don't want to step back again♪

102
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,800
♪I want a future by your side♪

103
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,280
♪Closer to you♪

104
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:39,480
Xifeng.

105
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:42,079
Cancel all my engagements tonight.

106
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:44,399
♪You make me certain♪

107
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:44,879
Mr. Xie,

108
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:46,639
is there an urgent meeting?

109
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:47,519
No.

110
00:05:48,319 --> 00:05:49,079
Tonight,

111
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,759
I'm going home early.

112
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:53,360
♪It must mean I was meant to meet you♪

113
00:05:54,740 --> 00:05:56,920
♪Closer to you♪

114
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:01,100
♪Closer to you♪

115
00:06:02,380 --> 00:06:08,960
♪You're the joy I just can't hide♪

116
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,320
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

117
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:13,760
♪If rain falls from a sunny sky♪

118
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:15,680
♪I'll tilt my umbrella toward you♪

119
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,680
♪If your courage ever fails♪

120
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,600
♪I'll walk beside you, step by step♪

121
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:22,440
♪Love isn't about possession♪

122
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:26,080
♪It's giving you my tenderness forever♪

123
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,000
♪Closer to you♪

124
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:30,280
♪Like spring blooming in my arms♪

125
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:32,480
♪Every little secret of mine♪

126
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:34,760
♪I want to tell you, one by one♪

127
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:35,760
♪I like you♪

128
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:38,280
♪Even silence turns sweet♪

129
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:40,160
♪If my heart had an orbit♪

130
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:43,120
♪It would circle around your name♪

131
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:45,720
♪Closer to you♪

132
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:49,560
♪Closer to you♪

133
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:57,280
♪You'll always be my favorite♪

134
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:00,920
♪Closer to you♪

135
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:03,320
♪Like the galaxy finally finding you♪

136
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:05,560
♪Deep within my soul♪

137
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:07,760
♪You've left your mark everywhere♪

138
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:08,680
♪I like you♪

139
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:11,080
♪This time, I won't hesitate♪

140
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:13,120
♪If love needs proof♪

141
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:16,040
♪I'll spend my life showing you♪

142
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:18,080
♪Closer to you♪

143
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:19,760
♪Holding you tight♪

144
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,880
♪Closer to you♪

145
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,480
♪Holding you tight♪
